@startuml
[*] --> Withdrawal Options : Initial Transition
Withdrawal Options --> Custom Value Entry : User selects custom value option
Custom Value Entry --> Transaction Verification : User submits custom value for verification
Transaction Verification --> Re-entry of Amount : Transaction is rejected
Transaction Verification --> [*] : Transaction is accepted

note right of Transaction Verification
  System verifies transaction
end note

Re-entry of Amount --> Withdrawal Options : User re-enters amount
Withdrawal Options --> Custom Value Entry : User selects custom value option
Custom Value Entry --> Transaction Verification : User submits custom value for verification

@enduml
